  "details": "Description\n\ni tried using two different osc applications that use osc to send information to my avatar and neither function properly.from what i can tell the port is not actually opened. \n\nReproduction Steps\n\nturn on osc and send information to the headset, it will not arrive. unrelated but these text boxes have no cursor to see\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Networking\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: SteamFrame (platform: Android - SteamFrame, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.2p2-1903-893363e7ab-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-01_10-42-51.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_1ca9817e-7727-4874-8d76-3fe2f27462ee/1/file)",
